<math id="S1.T1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{T}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the task number.
<math id="S1.T1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="DE,CE" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">DE,CE</annotation></semantics></math> denote the discrete and continuous environments.
</figcaption>
<div id="S1.T1.14" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:76.5pt;vertical-align:-36.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-47.6pt,10.6pt) scale(0.783709733130467,0.783709733130467) ;">
<table id="S1.T1.14.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S1.T1.14.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S1.T1.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="S1.T1.14.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Dataset</span></th>
